  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program consists of a multiple works operation that will finance integrated activities in urban and social services for selected low-income settlements in the Guatemala City Metropolitan Area. The operation comprises two components: (i) integrated projects; and (ii) program management.</narrative>
